# Runback needs no keys.
#
# Hyperliquid's info endpoint is public and answers `access-control-allow-origin: *`,
# so the browser calls it directly and every visitor spends their own rate limit.
#
# The only optional setting is which coins the landing-page gallery samples for
# live wallets. Comma separated, defaults to the busiest perps.
# RUNBACK_GALLERY_COINS=BTC,ETH,SOL,HYPE
